{
    "ja": {
        "Goku": "Goku",
        "And so he left, hungry for more.": "そして彼は去った、さらなる渇望を胸に。",
        "Default": "デフォルト",
        "Goku Black": "Goku Black",
        "Drip": "Drip",
        "Saiyan Blood": "サイヤ人の血",
        "Skills also require <color=#03bcff>Ki</color> to be used!\nPerform a <color=#FF5400>Main Transformation</color> by tapping <color=#03f4fc>C</color> (View Transformations Tab for more info).\nPerform a <color=#FF5400>Kaioken Transformation</color> by holding <color=#03f4fc>C</color>.\n<color=#FF5400>Power down</color> by tapping <color=#03f4fc>X</color>.\n<color=#FF5400>Fly</color> by holding <color=#03f4fc>Jump</color>.": "スキルの使用には<color=#03bcff>気</color>も必要となる！\n<color=#03f4fc>C</color>キーをタップして<color=#FF5400>メイン変身</color>を行う（詳細は「変身」タブを参照）。\n<color=#03f4fc>C</color>キー長押しで<color=#FF5400>界王拳変身</color>を行う。\n<color=#03f4fc>X</color>キーをタップして<color=#FF5400>変身解除</color>する。\n<color=#03f4fc>ジャンプ</color>長押しで<color=#FF5400>飛行</color>する。",
        "Melee Strike": "近接打撃",
        "Deal <color=#E5C962>280% Damage</color> each strike!\nGain <color=#03bcff>9% Ki</color> Per Hit!\n<color=#03f4fc>Auto-moves to targeted enemies.</color>\n<color=#03f4fc>Teleports instead if </color><color=#FF5400>Kaioken</color><color=#03f4fc> is active!</color>": "1撃ごとに<color=#E5C962>280%のダメージ</color>を与える！\n命中ごとに<color=#03bcff>9%の気</color>を獲得！\n<color=#03f4fc>ターゲットした敵へ自動移動する。</color>\n<color=#03f4fc>代わりにテレポートする（</color><color=#FF5400>界王拳</color><color=#03f4fc>発動時）！</color>",
        "Triple Kick (Legacy)": "3連キック（レガシー）",
        "Unleashes a trio of kicks! \nDealing <color=#E5C962>260% Damage</color> each!\nGain <color=#03bcff>5% Ki</color> Per Hit!": "3連キックを繰り出す！\n1撃ごとに<color=#E5C962>260%のダメージ</color>を与える！\n命中ごとに<color=#03bcff>5%の気</color>を獲得！",
        "Ki Blast": "気弾",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>6 Ki</color>\nFire off a speedy Ki Blast! \n<color=#03f4fc>Holding this skill fires an additional blast </color>\nDealing <color=#E5C962>350% Damage</color> for each one!\n": "<color=#03bcff>気 6</color>を消費\n高速の気弾を放つ！\n<color=#03f4fc>長押しすると追加の気弾を1発発射する</color>\nそれぞれ<color=#E5C962>350%のダメージ</color>を与える！\n",
        "Meteor Crash": "メテオクラッシュ",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>20 Ki</color>\nRapidly unleash a barrage of strikes! \nDealing <color=#E5C962>340% Damage</color> for each one!\n<color=#03f4fc>Holding this skill drains </color><color=#03bcff>10% Ki </color><color=#03f4fc>per second.</color>": "<color=#03bcff>気 20</color>を消費\n怒涛の連続攻撃を素早く繰り出す！\n1撃ごとに<color=#E5C962>340%のダメージ</color>を与える！\n<color=#03f4fc>長押し中は毎秒</color><color=#03bcff>気の10%</color><color=#03f4fc>を消費する。</color>",
        "Instant Transmission": "瞬間移動",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>25 Ki</color>\nFocus on your target and teleport!\n<color=#03f4fc>Distance is limited if there is no target</color>": "<color=#03bcff>気 25</color>を消費\nターゲットに意識を集中してテレポートする！\n<color=#03f4fc>ターゲットがいない場合、移動距離は制限される</color>",
        "Ki Charge": "気溜め",
        "Hold and Regenerate <color=#03bcff>20% Ki</color> Per Second\n<color=#03f4fc>Mitigates strain, allowing for extended Kaioken usage.</color>": "長押しで毎秒<color=#03bcff>20%の気</color>を回復する\n<color=#03f4fc>負担を緩和し、界王拳の持続使用時間を延ばす。</color>",
        "Kamehameha": "かめはめ波",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>30 Ki</color>\nCharge and unleash a Kamehameha, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1200% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active! \nConsume additional Ki and increase damage by <color=#E5C962>1000% Damage</color> per second of charging!\n<color=#03f4fc>Ki consumption gradually increases the longer you charge!</color>": "<color=#03bcff>気 30</color>を消費\n力を溜めてかめはめ波を放ち、照射中は毎秒<color=#E5C962>1200%のダメージ</color>を与える！\n追加の気を消費し、溜め時間1秒ごとにダメージが<color=#E5C962>1000%</color>増加！\n<color=#03f4fc>長く溜めるほど気の消費量は徐々に増加する！</color>",
        "Spirit Bomb": "元気玉",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>200 Ki</color>\nCharge and unleash a Spirit Bomb, Dealing <color=#E5C962>400% Damage</color> per 0.3 seconds to enemies within it! \nConsume additional Ki and increase overall damage by <color=#E5C962>1200% Damage</color> per second of charging!\n<color=#03f4fc>Ki consumption gradually increases the longer you charge!</color>\n\n<color=#03f4fc>If the Spirit Bomb collides with a boss or the ground, it will explode, Dealing </color><color=#E5C962>4000% Damage</color>\n<color=#999999>Gain Bonus Armor whilst standing still.</color>\n<color=#FF0000>Whilst moving the Spirit Bomb will not charge!</color>": "<color=#03bcff>気 200</color>を消費\n気を集めて元気玉を放ち、範囲内の敵に0.3秒ごとに<color=#E5C962>400%のダメージ</color>を与える！\n追加の気を消費し、溜め時間1秒ごとに総ダメージが<color=#E5C962>1200%</color>増加！\n<color=#03f4fc>長く溜めるほど気の消費量は徐々に増加する！</color>\n\n<color=#03f4fc>元気玉がボスまたは地面に衝突すると大爆発を起こし、</color><color=#E5C962>4000%のダメージ</color>\n<color=#999999>静止中は追加アーマーを獲得。</color>\n<color=#FF0000>移動中は元気玉に気を溜めることができない！</color>",
        "Angry Kamehameha": "怒りのかめはめ波",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>60 Ki</color>\nUnleash an Angry Kamehameha, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1550% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active!": "<color=#03bcff>気 60</color>を消費\n怒りのかめはめ波を放ち、照射中は毎秒<color=#E5C962>1550%のダメージ</color>を与える！",
        "Ki Blast Barrage": "連続気弾",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>80 Ki</color>\nUnleash an Barrage of Ki Blasts, Dealing <color=#E5C962>205% Damage</color> with each one!": "<color=#03bcff>気 80</color>を消費\n怒涛の連続気弾を乱射し、1発ごとに<color=#E5C962>205%のダメージ</color>を与える！",
        "Dragon Fist": "龍拳",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>225 Ki</color>\nCharge forward and unleash a Fiery Dragon Fist, Dealing <color=#E5C962>2400% Damage</color> to every enemy hit!\n<color=#03f4fc>Deals bonus damage to low health targets!</color>": "<color=#03bcff>気 225</color>を消費\n前方へ突進して猛火の龍拳を放ち、命中したすべての敵に<color=#E5C962>2400%のダメージ</color>を与える！\n<color=#03f4fc>体力の低い標的に対して追加ダメージ！</color>",
        "God Bind": "ゴッドバインド",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>150 Ki</color>\nChannel the Saiyan God's power and deal <color=#E5C962>800% Damage</color> and stun per pulse!\n<color=#03f4fc>Extend the duration at the cost of </color><color=#03bcff>10 Ki per second!</color>": "<color=#03bcff>気 150</color>を消費\n超サイヤ人ゴッドの力を引き出し、波動ごとに<color=#E5C962>800%のダメージ</color>とスタンを与える！\n<color=#03f4fc>持続時間を延長可能（消費コスト：毎秒</color><color=#03bcff>気 10）！</color>",
        "God Fist Kamehameha": "ゴッドフィストかめはめ波",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>300 Ki</color>\nCharge and Unleash a God Kamehameha, Dealing <color=#E5C962>4000% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active! \nThen continuing with a God Fist, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1200% Damage</color> to each enemy hit!": "<color=#03bcff>気 300</color>を消費\n力を溜めてゴッドかめはめ波を放ち、照射中は毎秒<color=#E5C962>4000%のダメージ</color>を与える！\nさらにゴッドフィストを叩き込み、命中した各敵に<color=#E5C962>1200%のダメージ</color>を与える！",
        "Godly Display": "神越演武",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>400 Ki</color>\nrapidly teleport and strike all nearby enemies dealing <color=#E5C962>600% Damage</color>!\nFinishes off with a powerful roar dealing <color=#E5C962>2000% Damage</color> to all nearby enemies!\n<color=#03f4fc>The number of strikes increases based on attack speed</color>": "<color=#03bcff>気 400</color>を消費\n高速テレポートで周囲のすべての敵を連続打撃し、<color=#E5C962>600%のダメージ</color>を与える！\n最後は強烈な咆哮を放ち、周囲のすべての敵に<color=#E5C962>2000%のダメージ</color>を与える！\n<color=#03f4fc>連撃数は攻撃速度に応じて増加する</color>",
        "Kamehameha x10": "10倍かめはめ波",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>60 Ki</color>\nCharge and unleash a powerful Kamehameha x10, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1300% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active! \nConsume additional Ki and increase damage by <color=#E5C962>1400% Damage</color> per second of charging!\n<color=#03f4fc>Ki consumption gradually increases the longer you charge!</color>": "<color=#03bcff>気 60</color>を消費\n力を溜めて強烈な10倍かめはめ波を放ち、照射中は毎秒<color=#E5C962>1300%のダメージ</color>を与える！\n追加の気を消費し、溜め時間1秒ごとにダメージが<color=#E5C962>1400%</color>増加！\n<color=#03f4fc>長く溜めるほど気の消費量は徐々に増加する！</color>",
        "Black Kamehameha": "ブラックかめはめ波",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>70 Ki</color>\nCharge and unleash a godly Black Kamehameha, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1700% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active! \nConsume additional Ki and increase damage by <color=#E5C962>1000% Damage</color> per second of charging!\n<color=#03f4fc>Ki consumption gradually increases the longer you charge!</color>": "<color=#03bcff>気 70</color>を消費\n力を溜めて神威のブラックかめはめ波を放ち、照射中は毎秒<color=#E5C962>1700%のダメージ</color>を与える！\n追加の気を消費し、溜め時間1秒ごとにダメージが<color=#E5C962>1000%</color>増加！\n<color=#03f4fc>長く溜めるほど気の消費量は徐々に増加する！</color>",
        "White Dragon Fist": "白龍拳",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>350 Ki</color>\nCharge forward and unleash a Fiery Dragon Fist, Dealing <color=#E5C962>4200% Damage</color> to every enemy hit!\n<color=#03f4fc>Deals bonus damage to low health targets!</color>": "<color=#03bcff>気 350</color>を消費\n前方へ突進して猛火の龍拳を放ち、命中したすべての敵に<color=#E5C962>4200%のダメージ</color>を与える！\n<color=#03f4fc>体力の低い標的に対して追加ダメージ！</color>",
        "DuoFinalKamehamehaSkill": "デュオファイナルかめはめ波",
        "Transformations": "変身",
        "KINGMOD_REMOVE": "解除",
        "KINGMOD_TOGGLE_EXTRA": "追加形態を切替",
